            "claim": "the-warden-drowned-the-bell"
          }
        },
        {
          "say": {
            "who": "drennan",
            "line": "Osric's seal. He cut the bell down himself. All these years I called it judgment - it was grief."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
