            "who": "ilva",
            "claim": "the-hush-is-judgment"
          }
        },
        {
          "say": {
            "who": "ilva",
            "line": "You lit the drowned nave. Judgment does not light lamps. I was wrong, and I am glad of it."
          }
        }
